# ============================================================
# IMPORTANT: the following are intentionally NOT ignored,
# because they are part of the reproducible public release:
#   data/truth_source/          -> read-only truth source (mock data)
#   data/knowledge_vault/       -> governed derived knowledge
#   data/derived/              -> RC1 runtime corpus (170 chunks)
#   outputs/                   -> frozen eval / gate / governance results
#   docs/                      -> final architecture, audit, roadshow
# ============================================================